            "BOOK_A other Parts and Part 3 (all combined*.txt searched, line-wrapped forms included; pages from the markers): p.3-95 (line 2618) 'That is usually 20 days: see Rr.3.31 and 3.34'; p.3-121 (line 3437) related provisions '3.31 (time to defend); 13.2 (calculating time)' and 'On the time to defend, see R.3.31' (official 13.2 is 'Application of these rules for calculating time'); p.3-122 (line 3460) '3.31 (statement of defence)'; p.3-126 (line 3553) 'statement of defence under rule 3.31(2) [Statement of defence]'; p.3-128 (line 3618) related provision '3.31 (form of defence)'; p.3-245 (lines 8074-8076) '3.31 [Statement of defence]' and related provision '3.31 (statement of defence)' (agree with the title); combined_rule12.txt p.12-13 (lines 532, 561 and 565), p.12-14 (line 602), p.12-16 (line 669), p.12-20 (line 863): '3.31 [Statement of defence]', '3.31 (defence)', '3.31 (time for service of defence)'; combined_rule13.txt p.13-17 (line 830) 'In rule 3.31(3)(a) [Statement of defence] the defendant must file and serve a statement of defence ...', p.13-66 (line 3490) checklist 'Note the deadline to serve the Statement of Defence (Rr.3.31-3.33)'; combined_rule4.txt p.4-3 (line 72) 'R.3.31 allows 20 days to file a defence'. Those other notes were not read in full in this pass.",
            
